  subgraph Legend[图例 Legend]
    direction LR
    LGS[数据流] --> LGE[交付产物为主]
    LRS[控制流] -.-> LRE[驱动下游为主]
    LPU[待定] -.->| ？示例 | LPE[尚未裁定]
  end
  style Legend fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#94A3B8,stroke-width:1.2px,stroke-dasharray:4 3

  subgraph Inputs[外部输入]
    IN_PRD[PRD]
    IN_BSP[BSP]
    IN_HW[HW 输入]
    IN_STD[STANDARDS]
    IN_TOOL[TOOLCHAIN/ENV]
  end

